  id: oldroot
  dexNumber: 181
  displayName: Oldroot
  lore: The first tree of the Mirefen, which got tired of standing. Its antlers are
    two whole canopies hung with lantern fruit, and the fen grows wherever it has
    walked.
  personality: Slow, watchful, forgives nothing done to the fen.
